Backend Setup:

1. create folder Server 
        cd server

2. initialize Node Project
        npm init 

3. Install Express
    npm install Express

4. Install TypeScript Devlopment Packages
    npm install -D typescript ts-node-dev @types/node @types/express

5. Create TypeScript Config
    npx tsc --init

6. Create Source Folder : crete index.ts inside src

7. Add Start Script : open package.json
    Replace  : "scripts": {
    "test": "echo \"Error: no test specified\" && exit 1"
    } 

    Replace with: "scripts": {
    "dev": "ts-node-dev src/index.ts"
    }

8. open tsConfig.json : update config.
    target: "ES2020",
    module:"CommonJS",
    "verbatimModuleSyntax": false,

9. Start Server : npm run dev

10. install Socket and cors
        npm install socket.io cors

