Frontend Setup: 

1. Create React app 
    npm create vite@latest client 
    select react and typeScript

2. Install Socket.IO Client 
    cd client
    npm install socket.io-client

3. Create Socket Instance
    client/src/socket.ts

    import { io } from "socket.io-client";
